Marcos von Sperling. Biological Wastewater Treatment Series, volume 2, IWA Publishing, 2007. [Publisher](https://iwaponline.com/ebooks/book/74/Basic-Principles-of-Wastewater-Treatment) · [DOI](https://doi.org/10.2166/9781780402093).

Work the whole volume, deriving the balance and reactor relationships before applying process examples. Connect reaction rates, hydraulics, physical separation, oxygen transfer and biological conversion. Compare idealized reactors with the residence-time evidence of an actual unit.

The publisher identifies the series as open-access; direct automated retrieval of this volume returned 403. Preserve the edition's actual rights and component notices. A complete numerical solution establishes the declared model, while plant performance still requires independent operational evidence.

